1	//! `add1` — universal +1 test slave.
2	//!
3	//! Smallest device that exercises every I2C-bus path the state machine
4	//! cares about: it ACKs writes, it ACKs the addressing byte, and it
5	//! drives a deterministic stream of read bytes (last-written + 1, +2,
6	//! ... mod `wrap`). Every other device — TMP101, EEPROM, DS3231 — is a
7	//! more elaborate version of the same shape.
8	
